  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>MT_MakeModule_SpecialistMortarPayload</defName>
    <displayPriority>19993</displayPriority>
    <label>make dual mortar payload amplifier module</label>
    <description>Increases the main mortar shell damage by 25% and explosion radius by 50%, retaining the shell type and its original effects. Fits only the dual mortar, in a left, right or top slot. Each type may be installed or queued only once per turret; the payload and support modules can be fitted together. Manufactured complete and cannot be upgraded. Requires a fixed 100 W. With Combat Extended, the existing CE ammunition system and selected physical shell type are retained. Auxiliary weapons are unaffected. Installation and removal each require 100 construction work. Removal has the normal 1% failure chance.</description>
    <jobString>Making dual mortar payload amplifier module.</jobString>
    <workAmount>30000</workAmount>
    <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedComponent</unfinishedThingDef>
    <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
    <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
    <effectWorking>Smith</effectWorking>
    <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
    <researchPrerequisite>MT_ExoticTurrets</researchPrerequisite>
    <ingredients>
